<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell eight points to 1,434.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell eight points to 1,434.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,434 today from 1,442 on April 9, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1461    13.264	  1462    13.269</p>
<p>   1a   1450 10986.000	  1459 11050.000</p>
